50 158 690 98 orangebox
orange 12 sansbold 68 222 moveto (Critical timing distinction) show
ink 11 sans 68 198 moveto (Reads use raw incoming S_t as queries; writes learn associations from post-core y_t. Therefore the core filters what reaches M_t.) show
ink 11 sans 68 176 moveto (The memory state is immutable-by-replacement and keyed by stream ID; it is not an nn.Parameter updated by the optimizer.) show
